 "summary": "The homotopy equivalence for a covering pulled back along a homotopy equivalence, the fibre equivalence for the fibre-product projection, and the finite CW structure on `univ : Set C` have no existing counterparts in Mathlib or TauCeti (TauCeti's HurewiczFibration/PathPullback only compares fibres along a path). The new code reuses `IsCoveringMap.liftHomotopy`, `eq_of_comp_eq`, the `toRelativeCWComplex` round trip and `cwComplexPreimage`, and generalises the two covering results in place with no leftover compatibility declarations.",
